{"3951230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Myrkwood: Offshoot", "steam_appid": 3951230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myrkwood: Offshoot is a top-down survival defense game that you can play with your friends! Spawn with 5 other people and defend the objective, the Gem, as Bombrats and hordes of monsters attempt to try to crack it. Dodge, slash, &amp; fight as you attempt to try to get the highest waves survived. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online/local multiplayer - You and 5 other players can join the same lobby and defend the Gem together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character! Buy upgrades &amp; items to help you defend the Gem!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with friends! Chat with your friends to help coordinate and communicate better!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice pixel art graphics! Well, at least we think so. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves! Fight through endless waves with increasing difficulty. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon crawler! Run through endless rooms &amp; fight through hordes of monsters as you try to get the highest completed room counts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variants! Enemies become more difficult by becoming stronger and having multiple powers to try to kill you! :)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myrkwood: Offshoot is a top-down survival defense game that you can play with your friends! Spawn with 5 other people and defend the objective, the Gem, as Bombrats and hordes of monsters attempt to try to crack it. Dodge, slash, &amp; fight as you attempt to try to get the highest waves survived. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online/local multiplayer - You and 5 other players can join the same lobby and defend the Gem together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character! Buy upgrades &amp; items to help you defend the Gem!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with friends! Chat with your friends to help coordinate and communicate better!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice pixel art graphics! Well, at least we think so. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves! Fight through endless waves with increasing difficulty. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon crawler! Run through endless rooms &amp; fight through hordes of monsters as you try to get the highest completed room counts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variants! Enemies become more difficult by becoming stronger and having multiple powers to try to kill you! :)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Myrkwood: Offshoot is a top-down survival defense game that you can play with friends! Defend the Gem as you fight through waves of enemies!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951230/ad746a8e2eaeac81440d7bfe011d5ac879fa141e/header.jpg?t=1776967441", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951230/35ee3ef9b577699e87815fec6d853a33f12cc5f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776967441", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951230/35ee3ef9b577699e87815fec6d853a33f12cc5f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776967441", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<